<title>USA: Waxahachie, Texas, $4.250 mln won by Southwest Sec.</title>
<headline>Waxahachie, Texas, $4.250 mln won by Southwest Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities said it won $4.250 million of Waxahachie, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.354 percent.</p>
</text>
